"""Display fab post: verify Semicon 2.0 support rates and display-fab thresholds against the gazette of 31 Aug 2026."""
from gc3common import load, rep, insert_note, save, SRC
S = "indias-display-fab-scheme-got-two"
t = load(S)
t = rep(t, "<div class=\"gb-warn\"><b>What this piece could not directly verify.</b> The exact clause wording and percentages for Semicon 2.0's 31 August 2026 notification are corroborated across five or more independent trade-press and legal-explainer sources, but this piece was not able to fetch and quote the primary PIB or MeitY document directly. Treat the specific support percentages above as well-sourced secondary reporting, not a verbatim reading of the gazette text.</div>",
        "<div class=\"gb-warn\"><b>Checked against the gazette.</b> The Semicon 2.0 scheme notification (MeitY, Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part I, Section 1, 31 August 2026, CG-DL-E-31082026-275860) was " + SRC + ". It sets fiscal support as a percentage of eligible capital expenditure, on a pari-passu basis: 40% for silicon wafer fabs, 35% for compound semiconductor, photonics, sensor and discrete fabs, 35% for display fabs (OLED Generation 6 or above, Micro LED and LCD Generation 8 or above), 35% for advanced packaging and 25% for legacy packaging. For OLED and LCD display fabs the minimum capital investment is &#8377;10,000 crore and the minimum revenue &#8377;5,000 crore; for Micro LED they are &#8377;1,500 crore and &#8377;600 crore, with capacity of at least 500 square metres of panel a month. These match the figures above.</div>")
t = rep(t, "but this piece could not directly fetch and quote the primary PIB release or MeitY gazette text due to network access limits during research, and the specific percentages should be read as well-corroborated secondary reporting rather than a verbatim primary-source quotation.",
        "and have since been checked against the notification itself: MeitY, Semicon 2.0 scheme, Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part I, Section 1, 31 August 2026, CG-DL-E-31082026-275860 (egazette.gov.in/WriteReadData/2026/275860.pdf), " + SRC + ".")
t = insert_note(t, "The Semicon 2.0 support rates and display-fab thresholds in this piece, earlier described as secondary reporting, have been checked against the scheme&rsquo;s gazette notification of 31 August 2026 (CG-DL-E-31082026-275860). They match: 40% for silicon fabs, 35% for compound semiconductor and display fabs and for advanced packaging, 25% for legacy packaging, and for Micro LED display fabs a &#8377;1,500 crore investment and &#8377;600 crore revenue floor.")
save(S, t)
